    WHEN `s 17(3)(f) any action prescribed for the purpose in subsection (1)` THEN `regulations prescribe the action for the purpose in subsection (1)`
    -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "includes in particular" does not close the list
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- (4) "Regulations may impose limitations on a work search requirement by reference to the work to which it relates; and the
-- Secretary of State may in any particular case specify further such limitations on such a requirement."
DECLARE `s 17(4) who may impose a limitation` IS ONE OF
    `s 17(4) regulations`
    `s 17(4) the Secretary of State in a particular case`
    `s 17(4) someone else`

-- src:189 | (4) Regulations may impose limitations on a work search requirement by reference to the work to which it relates; and the Secretary of State may in any particular case specify further such limitations on such a requirement.
@ref s 17(4) (src:189-189)
GIVEN who IS A `s 17(4) who may impose a limitation`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 17(4) a limitation may be imposed on a work search requirement by` MEANS
    CONSIDER who
